info: GMZP0/Audit.lean:493:0: GMZP0.cyclicModulusAverage_as_uniform_mean (N q : ℕ) [NeZero q] (p : GMZP0.Base N → GMZP0.Frequency)
  (X : Finset (Fin N)) (σ : GMZP0.Base N → ℝ) (lam : GMZP0.Base N → ℂ) :
